    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Generate Regulation Group Hash Key" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Generate Provider Hash Key</p>
            <p>Generates a provider hash key required for subsequent regulation-group operations.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> providerKey = yyyyMMdd from getProviderKey(); ttl = "10".</p>
            <step>Open System Settings menu and select "Account".</step>
            <step>Open the key generator, choose a provider (row 4).</step>
            <step>Enter provider key (yyyyMMdd) and TTL.</step>
            <step>Save and capture the generated hash into "hashValue".</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Hash key is generated and stored in "hashValue"; dialog is closed.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
